  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing Support to the Government of Sweden for the Resettlement and Family Reunification of Beneficiaries of International Protection with Their Family Members (2024-25)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will contribute to providing a durable solution to 900 beneficiaries of international protection in Morocco, Tunisia, Uganda and United Republic of Tanzania by facilitating their resettlement to Sweden, as well as contribute to family unity for approximately 40 family members of beneficiaries of international protection residing in Sweden by facilitating their family reunification to Sweden. The project will run from April 2024 to March 2025.</narrative>
  </description>
